---
import SectionHeading from "../SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="home-col grid gap-6 py-10 sm:py-14 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,2fr)] md:gap-16 md:py-20"
  aria-labelledby="about-title"
>
  <div class="md:sticky md:top-24 md:self-start">
    <SectionHeading num="02" label="About" />
    <h2 id="about-title" class="section-title">A bit about me</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 text-base leading-[1.8] text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-400 md:text-[17px]">
    <p>
      I'm <span class="font-medium text-surface-900 dark:text-surface-100">Kevin</span>, a product and AI engineer. I
      take ownership of problems nobody has scoped yet, lead the work from the first conversation to production, and
      stay accountable for it after launch. Lately that means putting AI agents into real products and running them
      securely, with clear permissions, guardrails, and evals, so they help people without putting their data and
      systems at risk.
    </p>
    <p>
      I've shipped for startups that move fast, nonprofits that make every dollar count, and public institutions where
      every decision goes through a process. Each one works differently, and I've learned to read the room, earn trust
      quickly, and deliver in all of them.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of work, I've spent more than 8 years volunteering with organizations across education, the environment,
      and tech, leading teams, organizing events, and starting projects from scratch. That's where I learned to lead
      people and bring them together around a shared goal. I'm also doing a Master of Public Administration at
      <a href="https://www.iesa.edu.ve" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">IESA</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
